  data: {
    LLM: "Always raise if you have a 3-card J-10-2 flush or better. The house edge is optimized by folding Very weak hands.\n\nFollow the 'Wizard of Odds' strategy: Fold any 3-card flush lower than 9-8-2. Play all 3-card flushes 9-high or higher.\n\nAlways make the maximum allowed Raise for 5, 6, or 7-card flushes, as they are strong favorites against the dealer's qualifying hand.",
    Player: "Always raise if you have a 3-card J-10-2 flush or better. The house edge is optimized by folding Very weak hands.\n\nFollow the 'Wizard of Odds' strategy: Fold any 3-card flush lower than 9-8-2. Play all 3-card flushes 9-high or higher.\n\nAlways make the maximum allowed Raise for 5, 6, or 7-card flushes, as they are strong favorites against the dealer's qualifying hand.",
